# Build context is client/packages/lowcoder; expose only the server script to the build.
# BuildKit already transfers only the files the Dockerfile COPYs, so this does not shrink
# the current build. It guards against a broader COPY (e.g. `COPY . .`) pulling in the
# package's sources and node_modules. It is only honoured by BuildKit (buildx / compose v2),
# not by the legacy builder.
*
!hocuspocus-server.js
